      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "More recent OLED screens aren't as bad as they used to be. Took an OLED switch being on for two years, with zero downtime, the screen being at max brightness, and on a bright screenshot to have a notable sign of burn-in. As is the mic icon fades when not in use and no one is using their headset non-stop for that duration without something else failing first. I'm skeptical this is a necessity.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
