      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I wanted to come back to this as I got the mic icon burn in on my beyond after 800 hours of mostly vrchat use... I had the pixel shifting enabled (you can't turn it off), but didn't have the mic hiding thing enabled as I'm used to the hud being there... so if you're planning to rely on only pixel shifting youre gonna have a bad time it seems.",
