  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-11-10T05:11:00.615Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The current behavior, even with the fading in and out, still quickly results in burn-in on OLED HMDs, at the very least the beyond.\n\nAn option to randomly adjust the position of the mic slightly on over time or on each world load would help reduce the amount of time the mic is displayed on any individual pixel, helping reduce the likelihood of burn-in",
